<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 2ND DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 2ND DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the second day of</p>
<p>the second England-New Zealand cricket test on Friday.</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings (overnight 56 for six wickets):</p>
<p> B.Young c Stewart b Gough	  8</p>
<p> B.Pocock c Cork b Caddick	  6</p>
<p> A.Parore c Stewart b Gough	 4</p>
<p> S.Fleming c and b Caddick	  1</p>
<p> N.Astle c Croft by Gough	  36</p>
<p> C.Cairns c Hussain b Gough	 3</p>
<p> L.Germon c Stewart b Caddick    10</p>
<p> D.Patel c Cork b Caddick	  45</p>
<p> S.Doull c Stewart b Gough	  0</p>
<p> G.Allott c Knight b Cork	   1</p>
<p> D.Vettori not out		    3</p>
<p> Extras (nb-2, lb-5)		  7</p>
<p> Total				  124</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-14, 2-18, 3-19, 4-19, 5-23, 6-48, 7-85,</p>
<p>8-85, 9-106, 10-124.</p>
<p>Bowling: Cork 14-4-34-1 (nb-1) Caddick 18.3-5-45-4 (nb-1)</p>
<p>Gough 16-6-40-5.</p>
